--[[
	AIChatUI  (LocalScript)
	============================================================================
	A complete, self-contained AI chat panel for Roblox.

	WHAT THIS FILE INCLUDES
		* Full chat panel built entirely in code (no assets, no image ids)
		* Floating toggle button with a smooth slide + fade open/close
		* Header bar: title, subtitle, live status badge, "new chat" button
		* Scrollable message list with bot / user / system message styles
		* Quick-suggestion chips that fill the input box
		* Rounded input box with placeholder text + Send button
		* Hover states on every interactive element

	WHAT IS NOT INCLUDED (ON PURPOSE)
		* No AI backend. No HTTP requests, no RemoteEvents, no DataStore.
		  The Send button is deliberately inert: it only shows a
		  "backend not connected" notice so nothing pretends to be an AI.

	HOW TO PLUG IN A REAL AI LATER
		Look for the two marked spots in this file:
			1) `sendRequest` below        -> route text to your server/API
			2) `handleIncomingMessage`    -> push the reply into the UI
		Everything else (bubbles, scrolling, sizing) is already done.

	INSTALL
		Roblox Studio -> StarterPlayer -> StarterPlayerScripts
		-> insert a Script named "AIChatUI" and paste this file in.
--]]

